            B.q("sa-m5-3", "sa-monitoring", "Application Insights telemetry from a very busy API costs too much, but the charts must still show accurate request rates and failure trends. What do you recommend?", listOf("Turn on sampling in Application Insights", "Turn off Application Insights", "Log only failures and nothing else", "Send the telemetry to a storage account"), setOf(0), "Sampling keeps a representative share of telemetry and adjusts the counts, so charts still show accurate rates and trends while far less data is stored and billed. Related items of one request are kept or dropped together.",
