            // Governance
            B.q("sa-m5-13", "sa-governance", "The Environment tag must be present on every resource group and may only be Prod, Test or Dev. Anything else must be refused at creation. What do you recommend?", listOf("An Azure Policy with the deny effect that checks the tag against a list of allowed values", "An audit policy that reports wrong tags", "A tag added by the finance team each month", "A resource lock"), setOf(0), "A policy with the deny effect is evaluated at creation and update, and refuses requests that break its rule. With a parameter listing allowed values, it blocks missing tags and typos such as Prd.",
