            B.q("sa-m5-18", "sa-relational", "A single Azure SQL database will reach 6 TB within a year. It currently runs in General Purpose. What do you recommend?", listOf("Move it to the Hyperscale service tier", "Stay on General Purpose", "Move to the Basic DTU tier", "Split it into a 6-database elastic pool"), setOf(0), "General Purpose and Business Critical single databases top out at about 4 TB. Hyperscale grows up to 128 TB, with fast backups and restores whatever the size.",
