            B.q("sa-m5-26", "sa-nonrelational", "Each time an order item changes in Cosmos DB, a downstream service must update a search index, in order per item, without polling. What do you recommend?", listOf("Read the Cosmos DB change feed, for example with an Azure Functions trigger", "Query the container every minute for recent changes", "Turn on TTL", "Use periodic backups"), setOf(0), "The change feed is a persistent record of changes to items in a container, in order per partition key. An Azure Functions Cosmos DB trigger reads it and runs code for each batch of changes, with no polling code.",
