            B.q("sa-m5-27", "sa-data-integration", "A nightly process must copy data in, run a Databricks notebook to transform it, then load the results, with one schedule, retries and monitoring. What do you recommend?", listOf("An Azure Data Factory pipeline with a copy activity and a Databricks notebook activity", "Three separate cron jobs on a VM", "A Logic App that emails the team", "Run the notebook by hand each morning"), setOf(0), "Data Factory orchestrates steps across services. A pipeline can copy data, run a Databricks notebook and load results in order, with triggers, retries and monitoring in one place.",
